Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " strives automatically to emphasize what it considers to be \"the \
interesting part\" of a figure, with the result that it has here clipped off \
some detail. I give two ways to override that defect:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.39483826420428*^9, 3.394838298465455*^9}}],

