 "This example, borrowed from \[Section]1.2 of Stan Wagon's ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica in Action",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " (2nd edition 1999), provides a taste of \"graphical discovery/exploration.\
\""
}], "Text",
